@startuml
title Zoho OAuth Refresh Flow

participant "Automation" as App
participant "Zoho Accounts" as Accounts
participant "Zoho Desk" as Desk

App -> Accounts : POST refresh_token + client credentials
Accounts --> App : short-lived access_token
App -> Desk : POST /tickets with access_token
Desk --> App : ticket id + ticket number

@enduml

